# scripts/dev/browser/profile-e2e — Playwright tests' persistent Chromium profile
#
# Same layout as the agent profile. Each dashboard e2e spec attaches to this
# instance over CDP and receives a fresh isolated context, so this profile is
# the long-lived Chromium holding the shared session.
#
# Start it with:
#   scripts/dev/persistent-browser.sh start test
# Override with:
#   AN_BROWSER_PROFILE=/some/other/profile

# Default profile directory: every sub-path except the explicit allow-list.
Default/*
